# 5. EMPLOYEE API

Admin endpoints:

```http
GET    /api/employees
GET    /api/employees/:id
POST   /api/employees
PUT    /api/employees/:id
DELETE /api/employees/:id
PATCH  /api/employees/:id/status
```

Support:

```text
Search
Pagination
Department filter
Status filter
```

Example:

```http
GET /api/employees?search=rahul&department=Development&page=1&limit=10
```

When creating an employee:

1. Create User
2. Hash password
3. Create Employee record
4. Generate employee ID
5. Return employee information

